["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/iban", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "International Bank Account Number (IBAN) is a system for identifying bank accounts across national borders standardized by [ISO 13616](https://www.iso.org/standard/81090.html). It consists of up to 34 alphanumeric characters, including a country code, two check digits, and a basic bank account number. While spaces may be inserted for human readability, they must be omitted when used for electronic data exchange (e.g., `IE64IRCE92050112345678`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/Relationship", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql", "_:N55a1e68c9b534619acb8a6be7ec6f41d", "localId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/bic", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Business Identifier Code (BIC), also known as SWIFT-BIC or SWIFT code, is a unique 8 or 11-character alphanumeric code standardized by [ISO 9362](https://www.iso.org/standard/84108.html) to identify financial and non-financial institutions (e.g., `BBWCUS33`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N926929240c2d444f92cd56c08573b5ac", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest", "_:Nf815b1ada894498d848cedde5344591a", "localId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ProfileIdentifierType/ai", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label", "ai", "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/nli", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[Natural Location Identifier (NLI)](https://eccma.org/enli-eccma-natural-location-identifier/) is a 14- or 15-character alphanumeric string standardized by [ISO 8000-118](https://www.iso.org/standard/85428.html) that uniquely identifies a three-dimensional geographic point location. The identifier is generated from geodetic coordinates and elevation data. For electronic storage, the `ISO.NLI:` prefix shall be retained (e.g., `ISO.NLI:41TS8M-A8ELTQ-H2`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/ListedLicense", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property", "_:N0b6d845d71ee48d49b4f9af1718761d2", "localId", "", ""]
